direction: down
source: Layercake GeoParquet (HTTPS)
build: iron-feather build
catalog: DuckLake catalog (small, local or S3)
parquet: Clustered Parquet files (S3)
pool: Shared read-only connection pool
http: OGC Features + XYZ MVT (cached bytes)
flight: Arrow Flight (cached native Arrow batches)

source -> build: bbox-pruned range reads
build -> catalog: atomic publish
build -> parquet: data files first
catalog -> pool
parquet -> pool: range GETs
pool -> http
pool -> flight
